    "ended": true,
    "history": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U01",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "我会列待办，但一直不太懂，为什么还要给每件事估个时间？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-001",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "因为待办清单只回答“要做什么”，时间估算还能帮你判断“今天做不做得完、先做哪件、",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U02",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "先别展开，简单说，它最直接就是防止我排太满，对吧？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-002",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "对。估时间最直接的作用，就是看出待办总量是否超过你实际可用的时间，避免排得太满。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U03",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "可我经常估不准啊，那写这个时间是不是就没啥意义了？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-003-feedback-U03-89766426db42",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "不是。估时间不求准，先粗估就有用；做完再对比实际时间，慢慢校",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U03",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-003",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "不是。估时间不求准，先粗估就有用；做完再对比实际时间，慢慢校准即可。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U04",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "那刚开始拿不准的时候，我该怎么写才不会一直纠结？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-004-feedback-U04-37655bfd6a89",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先按半小时、一小时、两小时这种粗粒度写；",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U04",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "明白。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-004",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "先按半小时、一小时、两小时这种粗粒度写；拿不准就写一个范围，比如三十到六十分钟，别追求精确。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U05",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "就拿复习一章来说吧，我老觉得很快就能弄完，你给我示范一下怎么粗估。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-005",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "别写“很快”，先按步骤粗估：通读二十分钟，整理重点二十分钟，做题或回顾二十分钟，再留十五分钟缓冲。合起来就写六十到七十五",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U06",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "不用拆这么细，直接告诉我最后在纸上怎么写就行。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-006",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "纸上就写：“复习一章，预计六十到七十五分钟。”",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "那我先改成短、中、长三档，不具体记分钟，这样可以吧？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007-feedback-U07-d355833c375b",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "可以。比如短任务、中任务、长任务，先用三档判断当天有没有排太",
        "playback_state": "speaking"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U07",
        "kind": "backchannel",
        "content": "嗯嗯。"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-007",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "可以。比如短任务、中任务、长任务，先用三档判断当天有没有排太满就够了。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U08",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "content": "要是做完发现比我写的档位长很多，下次该怎么改？"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "kind": "heard_prefix",
        "observation_id": "synthetic-observation-008",
        "source": "synthetic_pcm_timeline",
        "heard_text": "下次直接上调一档；如果连续几次都超出，就把这类任务固定记为更长一档。",
        "playback_state": "finished"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "turn_id": "U08",
        "kind": "end",
        "content": "明白了，我就先按三档粗估，再根据实际情况调整。谢谢！"
      }
    ]
  },
